{
  "title": "Astronaut",
  "about": "A chunky clay astronaut floating in a bright sky, for the Dinki Dell doof, tethered by the cover's blue tube. A ringed planet and a moon hang behind, the stars twinkle on the beat, one arm waves and the chest buttons light in turn; the visor reflects a studio spotlight (it was all filmed on a set). On the drop the astronaut does a full flip, the visor shows the all-seeing eye and the stars burst.",
